y calling `_add_delegate_accessors`\n157 |     below a class definition.\n158 | \n159 |     Parameters\n160 |     ----------\n161 |     delegate : object\n162 |         The class to get methods/properties & doc-strings.\n163 |     accessors : Sequence[str]\n164 |         List of accessor to add.\n165 |     typ : {'property', 'method'}\n166 |     overwrite : bool, default False\n167 |        Overwrite the method/property in the target class if it exists.\n168 |     accessor_mapping: Callable, default lambda x: x\n169 |         Callable to map the delegate's function to the cls' function.\n170 |     raise_on_missing: bool, default True\n171 |         Raise if an accessor does not exist on delegate.\n172 |         False skips the missing accessor.\n173 | \n174 |     Returns\n175 |     -------\n176 |     callable\n177 |         A class decorator.\n178 | \n179 |     Examples\n180 |     --------\n181 |     @delegate_names(Categorical, [\"categories\", \"ordered\"], \"property\")\n182 |     class CategoricalAccessor(PandasDelegate):\n183 |         [...]\n184 |     \"\"\"\n185 | \n186 |     def add_delegate_accessors(cls):\n187 |         cls._add_delegate_accessors(\n188 |             delegate,\n189 |             accessors,\n190 |             typ,\n191 |             overwrite=overwrite,\n192 |             accessor_mapping=accessor_mapping,\n193 |             raise_on_missing=raise_on_missing,\n194 |         )\n195 |         return cls\n196 | \n197 |     return add_delegate_accessors\n```\n\nFound class `pandas/core/accessor.py:Accessor`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n200 | class Accessor:\n201 |     \"\"\"\n202 |     Custom property-like object.\n203 | \n204 |     A descriptor for accessors.\n205 | \n206 |     Parameters\n207 |     ----------\n208 |     name : str\n209 |         Namespace that will be accessed under, e.g. ``df.foo``.\n210 |     accessor : cls\n211 |         Class with the extension methods.\n212 | \n213 |     Notes\n214 |     