method of ``Styler.relabel_index``. If a list\n3633 |             will call the method numerous times.\n3634 |         format : dict, list of dict\n3635 |             Keyword args to pass to the method call of ``Styler.format``. If a list will\n3636 |             call the method numerous times.\n3637 |         format_index : dict, list of dict\n3638 |             Keyword args to pass to the method call of ``Styler.format_index``. If a\n3639 |             list will call the method numerous times.\n3640 |         render_kwargs : dict\n3641 |             Keyword args to pass to the method call of ``Styler.to_latex``.\n3642 | \n3643 |         Returns\n3644 |         -------\n3645 |         str or None\n3646 |             If buf is None, returns the result as a string. Otherwise returns None.\n3647 |         \"\"\"\n3648 |         from pandas.io.formats.style import Styler\n3649 | \n3650 |         self = cast(\"DataFrame\", self)\n3651 |         styler = Styler(self, uuid=\"\")\n3652 | \n3653 |         for kw_name in [\"hide\", \"relabel_index\", \"format\", \"format_index\"]:\n3654 |             kw = vars()[kw_name]\n3655 |             if isinstance(kw, dict):\n3656 |                 getattr(styler, kw_name)(**kw)\n3657 |             elif isinstance(kw, list):\n3658 |                 for sub_kw in kw:\n3659 |                     getattr(styler, kw_name)(**sub_kw)\n3660 | \n3661 |         # bold_rows is not a direct kwarg of Styler.to_latex\n3662 |         render_kwargs = {} if render_kwargs is None else render_kwargs\n3663 |         if render_kwargs.pop(\"bold_rows\"):\n3664 |             styler.map_index(lambda v: \"textbf:--rwrap;\")\n3665 | \n3666 |         return styler.to_latex(buf=buf, **render_kwargs)\n```\n\n\n\n##Searching for term \"float_format documentation\", \"to_csv float_format float_format documentation\"...\n### Search Result:\nFound function `pandas/io/formats/format.py:FloatArrayFormatter.get_result_as_array`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using ke